<view class="page-container page-container--padded"><top-bar title="树洞"></top-bar><view class="page-shell__description">这里展示经过规则检查的匿名内容。请给彼此留一点空间和善意。</view><primary-button label="写一段树洞" bindaction="publish"></primary-button><state-message wx:if="{{error}}" title="内容暂时不可用" message="{{error}}" action-label="重新加载" bindaction="load"></state-message><view wx:if="{{loading}}" class="surface"><text class="muted">正在加载可以展示的内容…</text></view><empty-state wx:elif="{{!posts.length}}" title="这里还没有可以展示的内容" action-label="写下第一段树洞" bindaction="publish"></empty-state><view wx:else class="post-list"><view wx:for="{{posts}}" wx:key="id" class="surface post" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="open"><view class="post__meta"><text>{{item.displayName}}</text><text class="status-chip">{{item.status === 'published' ? '已公开' : item.status === 'protected' ? '保护展示' : '当前不可见'}}</text></view><view class="post__excerpt">{{item.excerpt}}</view><view class="muted">{{item.responseCount}} 条回应 · {{item.createdAt}}</view></view></view><bottom-nav current="treehole"></bottom-nav></view>
